  (text "Only one LED is on at a time,\nso one shared R3 sets the current:\nI <= (9 V - 2 V) / 470 = 15 mA\n(CD4017 output drive limits it to ~5-10 mA)\nD1-D10: 5 mm red LEDs" (at 246.38 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 242a569d-a245-4c4b-9ed2-6510f06714af))
